{"title":"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What time is it <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee8da3ffe8af46d91ed1dda233006a1c02caf442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b0722ee1befe40a29de4ff304099365cb621ed1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 11:00 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 9:35 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 11:15 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10:55 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 11:05$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"554\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee8da3ffe8af46d91ed1dda233006a1c02caf442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b7575810ecaa5f0b23bfc1d16dfda726c668fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more minutes after that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324b2144716f04f49fb469d57dc73a4d2b4ad0ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 11:05}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"98\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" st